dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.semio
start body
framing record

# W-S closer (`any`): REAL binary op frame, replacing the old whole-enum `serde_json` shortcut.
# `format u8` + `tag u8` (real mutation-variant ordinal, `🧬️mutations/🦀️component.rs`'s
# `mutation_tag`) are genuinely, individually protocol-walkable fixed header fields — matches the
# recipe's own §2.5 op-binary shape exactly (json's mutations protocol). Past the header, `payload`
# is the WRAPPED subset's own real `OpBinary::encode_op()` bytes (or, for `setSnapshot`, the
# wrapped snapshot's own real `ArtifactPack::encode_pack()` bytes) — one opaque trailing chain.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8

chain payload bytes
